title: Phase2_Waiting
tags: 等待回报
---
<<if $MonsterKilled == true>>
    旅行者，你回来了！你真的把它解决了？！
    太厉害了！村子终于安全了，谢谢你！
    <<set $QuestCompleted = true>>
    <<set $QuestAccepted = false>>
    <<set $Phase2Accepted = false>>
    <<CompleteQuest ClearBlackForest_Phase2_Kill>>
    <<jump DailyDialogueEnd>>
<<endif>>
去吧，我们在村里等你的消息，注意安全！
<<jump DialogueEnd>>
